nks: \"Home\", \"Workspace\", \"Activity\"\n        *   Card heading: \"Field Notes\"\n        *   Card subheading: \"Independent stories about design, technology, and cities.\"\n        *   Card caption: \"A long-form article continues underneath the privacy surface.\"\n        *   Banner heading: \"We use cookies\"\n        *   Banner subtext: \"Choose whether to allow analytics cookies.\"\n        *   Banner buttons: \"Accept all\", \"Reject all\"\n    *   *3) Inputs:* None visible (no form fields).\n    *   *4) State signals:* Cookie consent banner overlay at the bottom of the viewport.\n    *   *5) Blockers:* The cookie consent banner overlays the bottom of the page, potentially blocking interaction with content underneath.\n    *   *6) Unknowns:* The actual content of the article/image is hidden behind the gradient placeholder and the cookie banner.\n\n4.  **Refining and Formatting:**\n    *   Check constraints: \"no prose intro, no conclusion, no 'this screenshot shows...', no layout description unless it matters\".\n    *   Let's tighten the text.\n\n    1) Page purpose: WebScène blog/article page with a cookie consent banner.\n    2) Visible text: \"WebScène\", \"Home\", \"Workspace\", \"Activity\", \"Field Notes\", \"Independent stories about design, technology, and cities.\", \"A long-form article continues underneath the privacy surface.\", \"We use cookies\", \"Choose whether to allow analytics cookies.\", \"Accept all\", \"Reject all\"\n","role":"assistant"},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

